}{2} \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = 16 - 32 + 72 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = 56\n\n{/eq}\n\nTherefore, the displacement of the particle is 56 units.\n\nTo find the distance traveled, we need to consider the particle's direction of motion. We do this by finding the critical points of the velocity function:\n\n{eq}v'(t) = 3t^2 - 12t + 9 = 0 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle \\Rightarrow 3(t^2 - 4t + 3) = 0 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle \\Rightarrow 3(t - 1)(t - 3) = 0 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle \\Rightarrow t = 1, 3\n\n{/eq}\n\nThese critical points divide the time interval into three subintervals: {eq}[0, 1], [1, 3], [3, 4]\n\n{/eq}. We evaluate the velocity function at a point in each subinterval to determine the particle's direction of motion:\n\n{eq}v(0) = 0, \\quad v(1) = 4, \\quad v(3) = 0, \\quad v(4) = 4\n\n{/eq}\n\nSince the velocity is positive on the intervals {eq}[0, 1]\n\n{/eq} and {eq}[3, 4]\n\n{/eq}, the particle is moving in the positive direction during these intervals. Since the velocity is negative on the interval {eq}[1, 3]\n\n{/eq}, the particle is moving in the negative direction during this interval.\n\nTherefore, the distance traveled by the particle is:\n\n{eq}\\displaystyle \\int_0^1 |v(t)| \\ dt + \\int_1^3 |v(t)| \\ dt + \\int_3^4 |v(t)| \\ dt \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\int_0^1 v(t) \\ dt - \\int_1^3 v(t) \\ dt + \\int_3^4 v(t) \\ dt \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\left[\\frac{t^4}{4} - 2t^3 + \\frac{9t^2}{2} \\right]_0^1 - \\left[\\frac{t^4}{4} - 2t^3 + \\frac{9t^2}{2} \\right]_1^3 + \\left[\\frac{t^4}{4} - 2t^3 + \\frac{9t^2}{2} \\right]_3^4 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1^4}{4} - 2(1)^3 + \\frac{9(1)^2}{2} - \\left(\\frac{3^4}{4} - 2(3)^3 + \\frac{9(3)^2}{2} \\right) + \\left(\\frac{4^4}{4} - 2(4)^3 + \\frac{9(4)^2}{2} \\right) \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + \\left(16 - 32 + \\frac{72}{2} \\right) \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + \\left(16 - 32 + 36 \\right) \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10 \\\\\n\n\\displaystyle = \\frac{1}{4} - 2 + \\frac{9}{2} - \\left(\\frac{81}{4} - 54 + \\frac{81}{2} \\right) + 10