 need to convert their hourly wages to a common currency, such as US dollars, and then calculate their earnings for an eight-hour day.\n\nHere are the steps:\n\n1. Convert Navin\'s hourly wage from rupees to US dollars.\n2. Convert Luka\'s hourly wage from kuna to US dollars.\n3. Convert Ian\'s hourly wage from pula to US dollars.\n4. Calculate the earnings for an eight-hour day for each person.\n5. Compare the earnings to determine who earns the most.\n\nLet\'s do this step-by-step using Python code.\n```python\n# Given data\nnavin_hourly_wage_rupees = 160\nluka_hourly_wage_kuna = 25\nian_hourly_wage_pula = 34\n\n# Conversion rates\nrupees_per_dollar = 32.35\nkuna_per_dollar = 5.18\npula_per_dollar = 6.95\n\n# Convert hourly wages to US dollars\nnavin_hourly_wage_dollars = navin_hourly_wage_rupees / rupees_per_dollar\nluka_hourly_wage_dollars = luka_hourly_wage_kuna / kuna_per_dollar\nian_hourly_wage_dollars = ian_hourly_wage_pula / pula_per_dollar\n\n# Calculate earnings for an eight-hour day\nnavin_daily_earnings = navin_hourly_wage_dollars * 8\nluka_daily_earnings = luka_hourly_wage_dollars * 8\nian_daily_earnings = ian_hourly_wage_dollars * 8\n\n# Determine who earns the most\nmax_earnings = max(navin_daily_earnings, luka_daily_earnings, ian_daily_earnings)\nif max_earnings == navin_daily_earnings:\n    result = "Navin"\nelif max_earnings == luka_daily_earnings:\n    result = "Luka"\nelse:\n    result = "Ian"\n\nprint(((navin_daily_earnings, luka_daily_earnings, ian_daily_earnings, result)))\n```\n```output\n(39.56300092847627, 38.55421686746988, 39.38053097345132, \'Navin\')\n```\nAfter converting their hourly wages to US dollars and calculating their earnings for an eight-hour day, we get the following results:\n\n- Navin earns approximately $39.56 per day.\n- Luka earns approximately $38.55 per day.\n- Ian earns approximately $39.38 per day.\n\nTherefore, Navin earns the most after working an eight-hour day. The final answer is:\n\n\\(\\boxed{\\text{Navin}}\